 pkexec, polkitd, systemd, dbus
Description: desktop interface for managing USB device access with USBGuard
 USB Protection provides a native GTK4 and Libadwaita interface for
 reviewing connected USB devices, allowing trusted devices, managing saved
 rules, and receiving notifications about blocked devices.
 .
 Device authorization is handled by USBGuard. The desktop application and
 notification agent run without root privileges.
